# Harbor Walk — town theme (4 bars, loops). Soft pulse + sine bass + light PCM hat.
deck 1
bpm 96

track Lead id lead gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 50 env_mode constant vol 11
  gen vib_rate 4 vib_amt 8
  note 64 0 0.5 v 100
  note 67 0.5 0.5 v 95
  note 71 1 0.75 v 110
  note 67 1.75 0.25 v 90
  note 64 2 0.5 v 100
  note 62 2.5 0.5 v 90
  note 60 3 1 v 105
  note 67 4 0.5 v 110
  note 69 4.5 0.5 v 100
  note 71 5 0.5 v 115
  note 74 5.5 0.5 v 110
  note 71 6 0.5 v 100
  note 69 6.5 0.5 v 95
  note 67 7 1 v 105
  note 64 8 0.5 v 100
  note 60 8.5 0.5 v 95
  note 62 9 0.5 v 100
  note 64 9.5 0.5 v 105
  note 67 10 1 v 115
  note 64 11 1 v 100
  note 62 12 0.5 v 95
  note 60 12.5 0.5 v 90
  note 59 13 0.5 v 85
  note 60 13.5 0.5 v 95
  note 62 14 1 v 100
  note 64 15 1 v 110

track Pad id pad gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type pulse duty 12_5 env_mode constant vol 5
  note 52 0 4 v 70
  note 55 4 4 v 75
  note 57 8 4 v 70
  note 52 12 4 v 80

track Bass id bass gen gameBoyDmg * 4
  gen type wave wave_shape sine vol 14
  note 36 0 2 v 110
  note 40 2 2 v 100
  note 43 4 2 v 110
  note 40 6 2 v 100
  note 36 8 2 v 110
  note 38 10 2 v 100
  note 35 12 2 v 105
  note 36 14 2 v 115

track Hat id hat gen gbaDirectSound * 4
  gen waveform triangle vol 7 bitcrush true
  adsr a 0 d 0.04 s 0 r 0.02
  note 84 0.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 1.5 0.06 v 60
  note 84 2.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 3.5 0.06 v 65
  note 84 4.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 5.5 0.06 v 60
  note 84 6.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 7.5 0.08 v 80
  note 84 8.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 9.5 0.06 v 60
  note 84 10.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 11.5 0.06 v 65
  note 84 12.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 13.5 0.06 v 60
  note 84 14.5 0.06 v 70
  note 84 15.5 0.08 v 75
